# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-ZOD-20510278:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed zod version exists yet (all versions affected, published 2026-10-05).
          Mitigated: LogviewR's only zod array schema (log_search.pluginIds) is bounded,
          request bodies are capped at 10mb. Expires so the alert comes back if zod
          ships no fix; remove this entry once a fixed version is available.
        expires: 2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-MODELCONTEXTPROTOCOLSDK-20579853:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          CVE-2026-104850, client-side OAuth flow only (fetchToken issuer check).
          LogviewR only uses the SDK server side (stdio + HTTP transports), no
          @modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client import, so not reachable. Fixed in 1.31.0:
          remove this entry once the SDK is bumped.
        expires: 2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-ALPINE324-ZLIB-20541555:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          zlib 1.3.2-r0 from the Alpine runtime packages (sudo, fail2ban/python3), fixed in
          1.3.2-r1. Temporary ignore to ship v0.15.2, real fix is an apk upgrade of zlib in
          the Dockerfile runtime stage: remove this entry with that change.
        expires: 2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
